  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN Women Core Contribution (Global) 2022-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Guided by the Strategic Partnership Framework between the Australian Government and the United Nations Entity for Gender Equality and the Empowerment of Women (UN Women) 2022-2025, Australia provides  core voluntary contributions to support UN Women&apos;s mandate towards achieving gender equality and the empowerment of women and girls. Additional to this core funding, Australia also provides funding to support UN Women&#x2019;s activities at the regional and country level.</narrative>
  </description>
